==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þakka|lang=non}} which came from the {{proto|Germanic|thankojan|lang=is}}. Cognate with the Old High German {{term|dankon|dankōn}}, Old English {{term|þancian|lang=ang}} and Dutch {{term|danken}}.

===Verb===
'''þakka'''

# to [[thank]], to [[acknowledge]], to [[render]] (to give thanks)

